  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HomeRevival
  delay: 3
  healthOnWaking: 1
  fallenText: You fall... and the Heart Tree's light pulls you back home.
--- !u!114 &1522981856
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1522981853}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 15a260b2b7c4f264f890791a63a9db9b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HeartTree
  questWhispers:
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 00e21ff059394a4459d8cec92bc2d489, type: 2}
    text: Warmth stirs in the old bark. <i>Little one... you are safe here, inside my roots. But my strength is thin, and the clearing has gone quiet. Rest a moment. Then help me.</i>
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 09a9774284d0e6c44a03b94ad09483f7, type: 2}
    text: <i>The clearing still gives. Gather fallen branches and loose stones with your hands. Your resource bars (I) will fill.</i>
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f89173a9aeb790c4f9aeb1cc56e0e655, type: 2}
    text: <i>Now a fire for warmth and food, and a table to work at. Open the build menu (G) and set them inside my ward.</i>
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ffed2822f546824fa97d9d34216d5d5, type: 2}
    text: <i>Hunger and thirst find you even here. Pick berries, fetch water from the stream, and stew a meal over your fire.</i>
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8fd8f4db8a0b4d74cb71c5b4837010ac, type: 2}
    text: <i>Three stones around the clearing still hold my light, choked by cursed roots. Free them, and bring the Life Orbs home.</i>
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2614c1d189f3a034691f98f3d3efeee0, type: 2}
    text: <i>Across the stream stand old stones that were once a door. Feed them my light, and they will wake.</i>
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 08ed06b5fb8d1854c86788aa2a00156f, type: 2}
    text: <i>Beyond the portal the forest is sick. Make tools, go, take what you need, and come home before the door closes.</i>
  whispers:
  - Warmth stirs in the old bark. <i>Little one... you are safe here, inside my roots. But my strength is thin.</i>
  - <i>Gather what the clearing offers. Wood, stone, berries, water. Build a fire, and a table to work at.</i>
  - <i>Three stones still hold my light, choked by cursed roots. Free them, and the old portal may wake.</i>
  - <i>Beyond the portal the forest is sick. Go, take what you need, and come home before it closes.</i>
  talkedEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c06332984c04ae244b8513b7d0e6178c, type: 2}
  wardRing: {fileID: 313313493}
  ringSegments: 96
  menuRange: 7
--- !u!114 &1522981857
MonoBehaviour:
